{"W":1440,"H":13676,"bg":"rgb(10, 28, 31)","out":[{"t":"p","r":[-75,19,38,60],"tx":"A","fs":50,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[499,39,43,18],"tx":"HOME","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[566,39,53,18],"tx":"ABOUT","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[643,39,65,18],"tx":"PROJECT","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[731,39,35,18],"tx":"PLAY","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[790,39,68,18],"tx":"CONTACT","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[883,39,58,18],"tx":"RESUME","fs":15,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"fixed"},{"t":"p","r":[84,205,1272,132],"tx":"thrive","fs":110,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[221,399,998,169],"tx":"Design a brand for a company that makes stylish desk accessories . The brand should feel creative, eco-friendly, and perfect for modern workspaces.","fs":47,"al":"start","st":"italic","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[81,628,17,20],"tx":"00","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[82,687,1277,714],"src":"dp3u20lqd2b8MqVvTOntq9Bvb54.png","nat":[1277,851],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"h3","r":[84,1440,585,56],"tx":"Problem","fs":32,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[84,1506,1272,70],"tx":"The workspace market is split between overpriced premium products and low-quality budget options, with little focus on sustainability, modularity, or personality. Professionals struggle to find a brand that feels warm, modern, and functional while still being accessible.","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"h3","r":[84,1622,532,56],"tx":"Solution","fs":32,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[84,1688,1272,70],"tx":"Thrive offers a modern, modular, sustainable workspace brand that blends premium aesthetics with everyday affordability. Its warm, relatable identity and thoughtful functionality create a smart, calm ecosystem designed for real productivity.","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1840,34,20],"tx":"year","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"h1","r":[86,1843,728,324],"tx":"Thrive brings a refined, minimalist visual identity to modern workspaces, transforming functional desk accessories into a cohesive, premium yet accessible experience that reflects clarity, intention, and everyday productivity.","fs":36,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1870,291,35],"tx":"2024","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1936,76,20],"tx":"timeframe","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,1966,291,35],"tx":"3 Weeks","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,2032,42,20],"tx":"tools","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,2062,291,35],"tx":"Photoshop , Illustrator , Blender","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,2128,67,20],"tx":"category","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,2158,291,35],"tx":"Branding","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,2224,109,20],"tx":"collaboration","fs":14,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"p","r":[1063,2254,291,35],"tx":"Individual Project","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":"sticky"},{"t":"img","r":[85,2326,1270,64],"src":"ZXVw8IzxIRNgEd4tVZiLfPJMu3Y.gif","nat":[1270,63],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[83,2428,637,425],"src":"Q2O7X1dwIY3eJYXmhF9OR4yBxaM.png","nat":[636,425],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[720,2428,637,425],"src":"ToNqXPbOGbC4TA3jC4kiHiPzmBY.png","nat":[636,475],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"p","r":[235,2892,970,175],"tx":"The logo process involved a lot of experimentation with styles, symbols, and treatments. While some directions worked visually, they did not align with what Thrive stood for. Some felt too decorative, others too generic. Feedback from peers and mentors helped me realise I was overcomplicating the design. I stepped back and shifted my focus to simplicity. After refining and testing multiple variations, I arrived at a minimal, modern wordmark that feels confident, quiet, and flexible enough to grow with the brand.","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[83,3106,1275,327],"src":"uSHMFiPF7n22w4VCz2JBXyY.gif","nat":[1275,326],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[82,3467,1277,394],"src":"69h8BsAsHowI6GZmXdphfqENhGw.png","nat":[0,0],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[83,3892,1274,410],"src":"9wuysO25VIMSyaQafMQBPj8UMw.png","nat":[1274,409],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[83,4301,1274,410],"src":"pC0latKXXwpX6phislJJDSXTQhk.png","nat":[0,0],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"video","r":[78,4750,1285,296],"src":"https://framerusercontent.com/assets/S4f8opUtJ84qxdAepWrMIxMsxOM.mp4","poster":""},{"t":"p","r":[238,5089,965,140],"tx":"The colour palette for Thrive uses muted teal tones that feel modern and naturally grounded. Chosen to convey calm, clarity, and subtle luxury, the deeper teal adds depth and sophistication while the lighter tone brings balance and softness. Together, they create a clean, refined aesthetic that reflects Thrive’s affordable premium workspace identity.","fs":20,"al":"start","st":"normal","mv":""},{"t":"img","r":[82,5268,1276,182],"src":"wnQbvHpWhf9LQ5YFNSFSXWlzHw.gif","nat":[0,0],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[931,5489,427,555],"src":"0tqG4YIXAgoHrb3nzjHnFwcwN2A.png","nat":[0,0],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[83,5490,425,552],"src":"g8DTqGfDLMdYofaglikIOpTxr8.png","nat":[0,0],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[508,5492,423,550],"src":"3JbzeH173rbbqdLbSus13vQ1xM.png","nat":[0,0],"fit":"cover","mv":"","tf":"none"},{"t":"img","r":[797,5833,453,359],"src":"52C3ACJWE1jZTazAgPxcB2MC7sM.png","nat":[1920,1080],"fit":"cover","mv":"","